       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SEARCHALL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TABLE.
          05 WS-ENTRY OCCURS 5 TIMES INDEXED BY WS-IDX.
             10 WS-KEY PIC 9.
       77 WS-WANTED PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           SEARCH ALL WS-ENTRY
               AT END DISPLAY "NOT FOUND"
               WHEN WS-KEY (WS-IDX) = WS-WANTED
                   DISPLAY "FOUND"
           END-SEARCH.
           STOP RUN.
